      "item": "theoreticalsciences:dark_matter_collector",
      "title": "Dark Matter Halo Collector",
      "text": "Gravitationally focuses the invisible halo surrounding every galaxy.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 3$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Galaxies spin too fast for the matter we can see to hold them together. Something unseen supplies the missing gravity: $(thing)dark matter$(), about five times as much as ordinary matter, spread in a halo far beyond the visible disc. This collector gathers it - and the Nebular Gas my first stars are made from."
    },
    {
